{"data":{"body":"[P2] `attributes` bypasses scalar validation without receiving a mapping-container check. Consequently, an inactive count or parent alternative containing `attributes: []` passes prevalidation even though serialized span attributes are always mappings, and another branch can let the malformed requirement succeed. Add an attributes-specific validator that recursively requires a mapping or documented whole-value matcher while continuing to allow arbitrary nested keys and array values; include inactive-branch regressions.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx87-RE-G","finding_digest":"1b4526afd46fbe0e396777468406109a92eb6df14e1d6ed2f4f95b5eece11c45","finding_id":"arf_v1_dncsnl6un67a4olho5diibqqtk","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/validators.py::_span_selector_schema_errors::attributes-container-shape","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/validators.py::_span_selector_schema_errors::attributes-container-shape","line":433,"observation_digest":"41ac6bc7846f57d48279eecf77c8f5f1b3a895ccfa0fde876f7b329938fed99f","observation_id":"aro_v1_igwgxr4en5l5jatz53hxpshv6g","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/validators.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:35Z","review_id":"arr_v1_yboyssvojck5b3n7imgxlym5wn","reviewed_base_sha":"e48ac54502d3c14e2e3fa216c5e200dbb4c14ac2","reviewed_head_sha":"a1ba6a96298a252eb85bef43866ef1d3ccab66be","reviewer":"codex","start_line":433,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_c4dnngisu3qnjfmp7yalxf75dw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:35Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
